flowchart TD
    Details[Application form or validated semantic fields] --> Prepare[prepare_* tool]
    Prepare --> Validate[WorkflowService validates required fields]
    Validate --> Missing{Complete?}
    Missing -->|no| Collecting[Persist collecting draft and render details form]
    Collecting --> Details
    Missing -->|yes| Awaiting[Persist awaiting_confirmation draft + material hash]
    Awaiting --> Confirm[Customer presses Confirm with clientActionId]
    Awaiting --> Cancel[Customer cancels draft]
    Confirm --> Transaction[Atomic begin_confirmation\nexecuting state + attempt + idempotency key]
    Transaction --> Execute[DealershipClient protected operation]
    Execute --> Platform[Authoritative dealership platform]
    Platform -->|success| Receipt[Persist public receipt; replace stale draft card]
    Platform -->|retryable error| Retryable[Persist failed attempt; draft returns to awaiting confirmation]
    Platform -->|final error| Failed[Persist failed draft and safe error code]
    Receipt --> Restore[Restoration reconciles messages with workflow state]

    Private[Private booking lookup form] --> Lookup[Dedicated deterministic lookup endpoint]
    Lookup --> Grant[30-minute verified booking grant\nproof excluded from transcript, model, and saved profile]
    Grant --> Amend[Prepare amend/cancel draft with server-side booking ID]
    Amend --> Awaiting
